# L3 blind test: the H-pool judgment and any round output that carries a
# proposed挂接 are the answer. Per cohort discipline (H 池案源保密) they must
# never enter git — a leaked judgment destroys the blind test's only value.
# The task sheet and the skeleton generator are fine to track; these are not.
blind-test/*judgment*
blind-test/*.txt
blind-test/*round*-output*
blind-test/*挂接*
